nated unexpectedly due to unknown session 1 (pgsql error 08003)\r\nW0222 11:52:52.325958 1812049920 pg_client.cc:305] Session id 1: Heartbeat failed: Invalid argument (yb/tserver/pg_client_service.cc:1545    ): Connection terminated unexpectedly due to unknown session 1 (pgsql error 08003)\r\nW0222 11:53:02.326777 1812049920 pg_client.cc:305] Session id 1: Heartbeat failed: Invalid argument (yb/tserver/pg_client_service.cc:1545    ): Connection terminated unexpectedly due to unknown session 1 (pgsql error 08003)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis issue seeks to fix this behavior.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-10182]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-10182?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"karthik-ramanathan-3006","id":32414766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDE0NzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32414766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006","html_url":"https://github.com/karthik-ramanathan-3006","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karthik-ramanathan-3006/received_events","type":"User"